{
 "_metadata": {
  "description": "Gold benchmark (roadmap 1.10) for identity/form resolution: real DSLD label rows run through the production enricher boundary.",
  "expectation_basis": "Hand-authored from the label's printed chemistry and the IQM form keys, written before the enricher was run. Not copied from enricher output.",
  "input_boundary": "Each active_ingredients row is the cleaner's output for a real DSLD label, reduced to the fields the identity match reads (name, standardName, canonical_id, canonical_source_db, forms, quantity, unit). The enricher is not given any expected value.",
  "unspecified_cases": "unspecified-* cases pin that a carrier-only or form-less label must resolve to the canonical's '(unspecified)' form, never to a guessed chemical form.",
  "case_count": 55,
  "last_updated": "2026-10-03",
  "unmapped_cases": "unmapped-* cases pin fail-closed behaviour: a printed form the enricher cannot map keeps the canonical, gets no form_id and no bio score, and reports form_match_status 'unmapped'. Whether such a carrier word should instead default to '(unspecified)' is a policy question, not pinned here."
 },
